<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian-linked drones struck near Khartoum, killing four and damaging a United Nations building, while infantry fighting was reported along the Ethiopia-Eritrea border in Gemalo locality. The UK has expanded its travel advisory to include Arsi and East Borena zones, and clashes in Moyale have entered a sixth week, driving displacement despite peace talks. Tensions persist as the Sudanese capital rejected Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed's peace bid and a RSF-linked delegation visited Addis Ababa, while aid workers report both protection in Somalia and obstruction at home. The conflict has produced 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQT05MMDRfaG9tZGtTNWdvY051NWsyek1yZGYtNFh4WDdwaDMwaUxzeXJfUDFGZXFiejRsSEJZNjhJTkZEVi1NbzI0bVEtTUZweXBndXBHRnhqTkgyZGFrSk4xbzNYWnBBLUt3QVVqbjlRZWhJUFdGMU9iVktNUlNkSWh2RXFaZWdtVVM4X2hmRlExcUpuUTdRSzdmZFFPdnJQdUZVbUh2eWQydllRWFJhdTJHOWdrQnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bioengineer.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQTWhHZXMzanI2MmVfLWt2cG5wdUQzTXFhT3VGSlpMbmhFZ3R2SE1mSE5hQ0ZlQWczSzNpSWtZcnBxWHhWT3VzSGhXWUdzT05raFRwaXZRUWNSemZXTFhXUEx5c1ZDdHY5Y042b2x5RUYyZ0lOUE0yRXJVSktZejBXTEV4SmlUeFhvQUZUdHI5VUxFdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Wisevoter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiRkFVX3lxTFBFbXVPVVhlRzRvUDBxWjhVUWZ4enM1RFZsZUxoRDNod2xQTm5adEN3V3dnRFBydnAzbVlGMXNXTlZDLWtSQmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mereja&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQXzA4dVJNUmd0Ny1VUkxiUFJiNEd5bFd4T2NIZ2lqb3RDbGFlOG1fenNKTDExNlZTWHpFdjJQSzVLV0dZZS02NjlzT3BSbVp6X1pfSHNuaE1pODduLUdRYWN1WmJCYk9MclVsY3dOb0pKNDUxWFU5WWtxTUp4elpNakxPeHVGQkh0Y0ExZTlxbm9kUHNBVmVYQWxPNXl4dGVFcm1CSmM0